meta {
	name: AccessRestriction
	seq: 10
}

auth {
	mode: inherit
}

docs {
	BDD scenarios for the per-request access-restriction resource attribute (urn:altinn:authorization:access-restriction).

	Each scenario has a baseline request (All / no access-restriction) proving the access exists,
	followed by the restricted request proving the access-restriction removes (or keeps) it.

	Non-no access-restriction values require the altinn:authorization/authorize.admin scope.
}
